# Security headers for the static web build (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages
# format; see docs/LAUNCH.md for other hosts). Expo copies public/ into dist/.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy yet: Expo's web output and react-native-web
# inject inline styles, so a CSP needs testing against the real deployed
# origin before it's turned on - tracked in docs/LAUNCH.md.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
